{"id":"000W19","title":"Unlucky: Friday The 13th","author":"Jorava","solvedCount":6,"difficulty":2,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-11-13T17:50:10+00:00","posted":"Heute, 12:54 Uhr","rules":"Unlucky digits, killer cages, XV.\n\nSolve in Sudokupad\n\n\"Feeling lucky, punk?\" Wait, that's a different movie... and the quote's slightly off... Anyway: Happy Friday 13th!\n\n-----\n\nRules:\n\nNormal sudoku rules apply. Place the digits 1-9 in every row, column, and 3x3 box.\n\nXV:\nThe values of digits paired by X sum to 10. The values of digits paired by V sum to 5.\n\nKiller Cages:\nThe values of digits in a cage cannot repeat and must sum to the number in the top left corner of the cage.\n\nUnlucky:\nThere is exactly one unlucky digit in every row, column, and 3x3 box. Unlucky digit's value drops by 1 (e.g. 8 becomes a 7). None of the unlucky digits share the same value.","solutionCode":"Column 7","tags":["Sudoku","XV (Variante)","Killer (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/5r45tvw2rm","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/5r45tvw2rm","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":7,"hasSolution":true,"features":["overlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-11-13T17:50:10+00:00"}